<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 98.30 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 98.30 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought 98.30 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 99.16 million rand on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
